fyclip (2.5.0-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Release FyClip 2.5.0 with quick-paste overlay and From/To date filtering.
  * Harden update downloads, archive extraction, and SHA-256 verification.
  * Validate and bound clipboard history, images, snippets, and backup imports.
  * Preserve legacy encryption keys to prevent history loss during migration.
  * Update build metadata and fix Linux icon and screenshot packaging.
  * Require Go 1.26.1 for package builds.

